# cards: the Red Dragon card halves fire damage (docs/plan-cards.md 4). The Red Dragon's fight as boss_reddragon.plan,
# Jian without the Red Dragon card (261, his slot 0x020B46A2); Jian's battle HP (0x0228E874) is
# watched (set to 999 at the start; no strength cheat, so the dragon hits him), the dragon's (battler 9, 0x0228EC40) pinned so it lives to act. Run with the other plan: the same inputs give
# the same rolls, so Jian's fire damage
# here should be half of that run's. Run with --save.
watch u16 0x020B85BE event_battle_id
watch u16 0x020B85C0 battle_mode
watch u16 0x020B85C8 result_sub
watch u32 0x020B8610 exp_pool
watch u32 0x020B4824 silver
watch u32 0x020B4694 jian_exp32
watch u32 0x020B4664 jian_level
include boot_from_save
pin u16 0x020B77EC 6
press Right 40
press Down,Right 40
press Right 40
press Down 80
wait 200
unpin
wait 30
shot reddragon_field
peek u32 0x020B4694 jian_exp_before
peek u32 0x020B4664 jian_level_before
peek u32 0x020B4824 silver_before
poke u16 0x020B7838 1
poke u16 0x020B783A 8
poke u32 0x020B0010 0x73
wait 240
shot reddragon_intro
poke u32 0x0228e874 999
watch u32 0x0228e874 jian_hp
pin u32 0x0228ec40 5000
watch u32 0x0228e8e0 slot1_hp
battlers
peek u32 0x020B85B8 area_group
peek u16 0x020B85BC map
peek u32 0x020B8620 stats_ptr
dump 0x0228E860 0x5E8 stat_records
